5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need a sustainable system. I suggest we look into the costs and the actual usage patterns first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should determine the actual time commitment required for these tasks before committing to a year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,It would be wise to see if the current workload is distributed fairly relative to how much we use the space.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I just want the rooms to be consistently clean. I'm tired of the guesswork every time I enter the bathroom.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Let's make sure we choose something that keeps us all happy and friendly. Harmony is more important than the chores.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, which specific data points do you think would clarify the time commitment?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,The stopwatch timing and perhaps the standard terms of an outside firm to see the professional benchmark.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll look into the kitchen use and the wall calendar to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I want to know why the quality varies. I'll check what everyone counts as ""done"" and the grout situation.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look at the house chat rows and the note from previous tenants to avoid past mistakes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will handle the spray receipts and the management office rate sheet to get a handle on the finances.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That sounds comprehensive.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm happy with that.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
