60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The options are Standing Assignments, a Paid Cleaning Service, or a Fixed Weekly Rota.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Given the time involved and the risk of conflict, the service is tempting despite the cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I still worry about the cost split, but a rota is clearly unfair given the absences.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,I'm voting for the Paid Cleaning Service. I can't deal with the grout and the arguments.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,I also vote for the Paid Cleaning Service. It's the only way to ensure we stay friends.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we go with the service, I'll manage the billing to ensure no one is out of pocket.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,That solves the financial concern. I'll vote for the service to save my time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If Toshio handles the money and we all agree to the rate, I'm on board.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,Great.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,Wonderful.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for the Paid Cleaning Service as well. It's the most logical way to avoid disputes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It's settled then.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. I'll vote for the service.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,Perfect.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we agree.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
